---
import {
  ADDRESS,
  COMPANY_NAME,
  EMAIL_ADDRESS,
  PHONE_NUMBER,
} from "../data/consts";
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  siteTitle=`Privacy Policy | ${COMPANY_NAME}  | New Century KS`
  siteDescription=`${COMPANY_NAME}'s privacy policy explains how we collect, use, and protect your personal information when you use our website and services.`
  keywords="privacy policy, data protection, GDPR, pilot intructional center, privacy rights"
>
  <div class="bg-logo">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-40 lg:py-56 lg:px-8">
      <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none">
        <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8">
          Privacy Policy for the Pilot Instructional Center Website
        </h1>

        <p class="text-gray-600 mb-8">
          <strong>Last Updated:</strong>
          {new Date().toLocaleDateString()}
        </p>

        <div class="space-y-8 border-y border-primary-300 py-8">
          <section class="my-4 border-b border-primary-300 py-4">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4">
              1. Information We Collect
            </h2>
            <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
              We collect personal information you voluntarily provide to us when
              you:
            </p>
            <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-gray-700">
              <li>Fill out forms on our website</li>
              <li>Schedule a discovery flight or training session</li>
              <li>Subscribe to our newsletter or updates</li>
              <li>Communicate with us by phone, email, or text</li>
              <li>Create an account or interact with our CRM system</li>
            </ul>
          </section>

          <section class="my-4 border-b border-primary-300 py-4">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4">
              2. How We Use Your Information
            </h2>
            <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
              We use the information collected to:
            </p>
            <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-gray-700">
              <li>Provide, schedule, and manage training services</li>
              <li>Respond to your inquiries or support requests</li>
              <li>Send updates about your training, billing, or promotions</li>
              <li>Comply with applicable laws and regulations</li>
              <li>Improve our website, marketing, and services</li>
            </ul>
          </section>

          <section class="my-4 border-b border-primary-300 py-4">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4">
              3. SMS Communications
            </h2>
            <p class="text-gray-700">
              By providing your phone number, you agree to receive SMS
              communications from {COMPANY_NAME} regarding scheduling, confirmations,
              and promotional updates. Message and data rates may apply.
            </p>
            <p class="text-gray-700 mt-4 font-semibold">
              SMS consent is not shared with third parties.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section class="my-4 border-b border-primary-300 py-4">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4">
              4. Information Sharing
            </h2>
            <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
              We do not sell or rent your personal information. We may share
              information:
            </p>
            <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-gray-700">
              <li>
                With trusted service providers that help operate our business
              </li>
              <li>
                To comply with legal obligations or law enforcement requests
              </li>
              <li>
                To protect the rights and safety of our users and our business
              </li>
              <li>
                In the event of a company acquisition, merger, or asset transfer
              </li>
            </ul>
          </section>

          <section class="my-4 border-b border-primary-300 py-4">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4">
              5. Cookies and Tracking
            </h2>
            <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
              We use cookies and similar tracking technologies to enhance your
              experience and collect usage data. These may be used to:
            </p>
            <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-gray-700">
              <li>Remember your preferences and settings</li>
              <li>Measure website performance and traffic patterns</li>
              <li>Provide targeted content and promotions</li>
            </ul>
            <p class="text-gray-700 mt-4">
              You can modify your cookie settings through your browser.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section class="my-4 border-b border-primary-300 py-4">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4">
              6. Data Security
            </h2>
            <p class="text-gray-700">
              We implement appropriate safeguards to protect your personal
              information from unauthorized access, use, or disclosure.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section class="my-4 border-b border-primary-300 py-4">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4">
              7. Your Rights
            </h2>
            <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
              Depending on your location, your rights may include:
            </p>
            <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-gray-700">
              <li>Accessing the personal data we hold about you</li>
              <li>Requesting corrections to inaccurate information</li>
              <li>Requesting deletion of your information</li>
              <li>Objecting to or limiting certain processing activities</li>
              <li>Requesting transfer of your data (data portability)</li>
            </ul>
          </section>

          <section class="my-4 border-b border-primary-300 py-4">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4">
              8. Children's Privacy
            </h2>
            <p class="text-gray-700">
              Our services are not directed at children under the age of 13. We
              do not knowingly collect personal information from children.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section class="my-4 border-b border-primary-300 py-4">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4">
              9. Changes to This Policy
            </h2>
            <p class="text-gray-700">
              We may update this policy periodically. Any material changes will
              be posted on this page with a revised effective date.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4">
              10. Contact Us
            </h2>
            <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
              If you have questions about this Privacy Policy or our data
              practices, please contact us:
            </p>
            <div class="bg-gray-50 p-6 rounded-lg">
              <p class="text-gray-700">
                <strong>Email:</strong>
                <a
                  href={`mailto:${EMAIL_ADDRESS}`}
                  class="text-primary-600 hover:text-primary-700"
                  >{EMAIL_ADDRESS}</a
                >
              </p>
              <p class="text-gray-700">
                <strong>Phone:</strong>
                <a
                  href={`tel:${PHONE_NUMBER}`}
                  class="text-primary-600 hover:text-primary-700"
                  >{PHONE_NUMBER}</a
                >
              </p>
              <p class="text-gray-700"><strong>Address:</strong> {ADDRESS}</p>
            </div>
          </section>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
